          "reviewedOn": "2026-07-22",
          "evidence": "Authored module notes: Captures rekordbox user preferences from %APPDATA%\\Pioneer\\rekordbox: options.xml (UI/audio/deck/mixer settings), shortcut.xml (hotkeys), device\\ (controller/MIDI mappings), setting.xml (cue colors/UI state), and MyTag\\ (custom label definitions). Excludes the master.db library database (large, contains machine-specific absolute track paths — must be re-imported), waveform/artwork caches, logs, and any license blobs. Confidence: medium — paths inferred from known rekordbox Windows data layout and community-documented backup procedures; options.xml and device\\ mappings are the highest-value portable artifacts. Authored secret warning: Any license or activation data stored under %APPDATA%\\Pioneer\\rekordbox\\license MUST NOT be auto-restored; license entitlements are account-bound and re-activated via the AlphaTheta account portal after install. Authored excluded secret or machine-bound paths: %APPDATA%\\Pioneer\\rekordbox\\license"
